{"unit_id": "tag:01JF:title", "translation": "一个可表性（representability）判据", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "representability", "target_term": "可表性"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "representability", "target_term": "可表性", "context": "本节所给判据检验的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01JF:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节将重新表述粘合（glueing）引理，即第<REF_0001>节的引理，表述将采用函子（functors）的语言。先回顾范畴（Categories）一章第<REF_0002>节中的一些内容。\n回顾一下，给定概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>，可以定义函子（functor）\n<MATH_0002>\n这称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0003>的点函子（functor of points）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设<MATH_0004>为反变函子（contravariant functor），其源范畴（category）由概形（schemes）构成，其目标范畴（category）由集合（sets）构成。用公式写为\n<MATH_0005>\n我们沿用景（Sites）一章第<REF_0003>节的术语。具体来说，给定概形（scheme）<MATH_0006>、元素（element）<MATH_0007>和态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>，我们用<MATH_0009>表示元素（element）<MATH_0010>，有时甚至使用记号<MATH_0011>\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "functor of points", "target_term": "点函子"}, {"source_term": "contravariant functor", "target_term": "反变函子"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "用函子重新表述的引理"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "重新表述粘合引理所用的语言"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "回顾内容所出自的章节"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义点函子时给定的空间"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "由给定概形所定义的函子"}, {"source_term": "functor of points", "target_term": "点函子", "context": "所定义的函子的名称"}, {"source_term": "contravariant functor", "ta