{"unit_id": "tag:01JG:statement", "translation": "（见范畴（Categories）一章的定义<REF_0001>。）\n设<MATH_0001>为反变函子（contravariant functor），其源范畴（category）由概形（schemes）构成，其目标范畴（category）由集合（sets）构成（如上所述）。\n如果下面的条件成立，就称<MATH_0002><TEXTITOPEN_0001>可由概形表示（representable by a scheme）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>或<TEXTITOPEN_0002>可表（representable）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>：存在一个概形（scheme）<MATH_0003>，使得<MATH_0004>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "contravariant functor", "target_term": "反变函子"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "representable by a scheme", "target_term": "可由概形表示"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "被引用定义所在的章节"}, {"source_term": "contravariant functor", "target_term": "反变函子", "context": "所考虑的函子类型"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "该函子的源范畴"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "源范畴中的对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "该函子的目标范畴"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "目标范畴中的对象"}, {"source_term": "representable by a scheme", "target_term": "可由概形表示", "context": "以存在满足所列条件的概形来定义"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表", "context": "同一定义的简写名称"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "在定义条件中要求存在的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01JF:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n假设<MATH_0001>可表（representable），由概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>表示，并且<MATH_0003>是同构（isomorphism）。\n根据范畴（Categories）一章中的Yoneda引理（Yoneda Lemma）<REF_0001>，二元组（pair）<MATH_0004>若存在，则在唯一同构（isomorphism）的意义下唯一。\n此外，Yoneda引理（Yoneda lemma）指出，给定任意一个如上的反变函子（contravariant functor）<MATH_0005>和任意概形（scheme）<MATH_0006>，有双射（bijection）\n<MATH_0007>\n反向的构造如下。给定任意<MATH_0008>，函子（functors）的变换（transformation）<MATH_0009>给每个态射（morphism）<MATH_0010>指定元素（element）<MATH_0011>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n特别地，若<MATH_0012>可表（representable），则存在概形（scheme）<MATH_0013>和元素（element）<MATH_0014>，使得相应的态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>是同构（isomorphism）。\n在这种情况下，我们也说<TEXTITOPEN_0001>二元组（pair）<MATH_0016>表示（represents）<MATH_0017><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n元素（element）<MATH_0018>常被称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>“泛族（universal family）”<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，其中的缘由在讨论代数叠（algebraic stacks）时会更加清楚（在此插入将来的引用）。\n目前只需注意，若二元组（pair）<MATH_0019>表示（represents）<MATH_0020>，则每个元素（element）<MATH_0021>（对于任意<MATH_0022>）都具有形式<MATH_0023>，其中的态射（morphism）<MATH_0024>唯一。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "Yoneda Lemma", "target_term": "Yoneda引理"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "Yoneda lemma", "target_term": "Yoneda引理"}, {"source_term": "contravariant functor", "target_term": "反变函子"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "transformation", "target_term": "变换"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_t