{"unit_id": "tag:01JH:statement", "translation": "考虑如下规则，它给每个概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>指定集合（set）<MATH_0002>。可以把这一规则变为反变函子（contravariant functor），做法是对态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>采用拉回（pullback）映射（map）<MATH_0004>。\n给定环（ring）<MATH_0005>和元素（element）<MATH_0006>，存在唯一的环（ring）同态（homomorphism）<MATH_0007>，它将<MATH_0008>映到（maps）<MATH_0009>。\n因此，由引理<REF_0001>可知\n<MATH_0010>\n这确实给出同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0011>。\n“泛族（universal family）”<MATH_0012>是什么？为求得它，须将上面的等同应用于<MATH_0013>。\n显然，在上述等同下，由此得到\n<MATH_0014>\n与预期一致。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "contravariant functor", "target_term": "反变函子"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映到"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "universal family", "target_term": "泛族"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "规则所作用的每个对象"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "规则为每个概形指定的集合"}, {"source_term": "contravariant functor", "target_term": "反变函子", "context": "赋予规则在态射上的作用后得到的函子"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "构造反变作用时要处理的态射"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "在态射上的反变作用"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "用于给出反变作用的映射"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "给定元素所在的环"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "确定同态的数据"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "所求同态的结构类型"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态", "context": "由给定元素唯一确定的同态"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term