{"unit_id": "tag:01JF:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在条件（4）中，若<MATH_0001>可表（representable），且由开浸入（open immersions）表示，对所有<MATH_0002>皆如此，那么要验证<MATH_0003>覆盖（covers）<MATH_0004>，只需验证<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>为一个域（field）的谱（spectrum）时成立。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "covers", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表", "context": "每个指标所需的可表性"}, {"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "用于表示各子函子的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "covers", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "要检验的覆盖关系"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "用于检验覆盖的谱所对应的域"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱", "context": "检验覆盖时所考虑的空间"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01JJ:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为反变函子（contravariant functor），其源范畴（category）由概形（schemes）构成，目标范畴（category）由集合（sets）构成。假设：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>满足层性质（sheaf property），这里使用的是扎里斯基拓扑（topology）；\n<STRUCT_0003> 存在集合（set）<MATH_0003>及一族子函子（subfunctors）<MATH_0004>，使得\n<STRUCT_0004>\n<STRUCT_0005> 每个<MATH_0005>都可表（representable）；\n<STRUCT_0006> 每个<MATH_0006>都可表（representable），且由开浸入（open immersions）表示；\n<STRUCT_0007> 族<MATH_0007>覆盖（covers）<MATH_0008>。\n<STRUCT_0008>\n<STRUCT_0009>\n那么<MATH_0009>可表（representable）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "contravariant functor", "target_term": "反变函子"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf property", "target_term": "层性质"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "扎里斯基拓扑"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "subfunctors", "target_term": "子函子"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "covers", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "contravariant functor", "target_term": "反变函子", "context": "引理所讨论的函子类型"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "给定函子的源范畴"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "该源范畴的对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "给定函子的目标范畴"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "该目标范畴的对象"}, {"source_term": "sheaf property", "target_term": "层性质", "context": "引理的第一项假设"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "扎里斯基拓扑", "context": "层性质所针对的拓扑"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "对子函子族作指标的集合"}, {"source_term": "subfunctors", 