{"unit_id": "tag:01JJ:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme），它表示（representing）<MATH_0002>，并设<MATH_0003>为“泛族（universal family）”。\n由于<MATH_0004>可表（representable），且由开浸入（open immersions）表示，存在开集（open）<MATH_0005>，使得<MATH_0006>可分解（factors through），且分解经过<MATH_0007>，当且仅当<MATH_0008>。\n特别地，<MATH_0009>，从而得到典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0010>，使得<MATH_0011>。由<MATH_0012>的定义可知，这蕴含<MATH_0013>可分解（factors through），且分解经过<MATH_0014>。\n由于<MATH_0015>，可得\n<MATH_0016>\n这是因为二元组（pair）<MATH_0017>表示（represents）<MATH_0018>。\n特别地，映射（maps）<MATH_0019>是同构（isomorphisms），其两端均为概形（schemes）。\n接下来要证明<MATH_0020>。\n这成立是因为（甲）<MATH_0021>是满足以下条件的最大开集（open）：它是<MATH_0022>的开集，且<MATH_0023>限制（restricts）到其上所得的是<MATH_0024>的一个元素（element）；（乙）<MATH_0025>是满足以下条件的最大开集（open）：它是<MATH_0026>的开集，且<MATH_0027>限制（restricts）到其上所得的是<MATH_0028>的一个元素（element）；以及（丙）<MATH_0029>。此外，第<REF_0001>节中的上闭链条件（cocycle condition）也成立，因为<MATH_0030>和<MATH_0031>都将<MATH_0032>拉回（pullback）为元素（element）<MATH_0033>。\n于是，可应用引理<REF_0002>得到概形（scheme）<MATH_0034>，它带有开（open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0035>和同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0036>，具有引理<REF_0003>所述的性质。\n令<MATH_0037>。\n引理<REF_0004>的条件蕴含<MATH_0038>。\n因此，由于<MATH_0039>满足层条件（sheaf condition）（就扎里斯基拓扑（topology）而言），可知存在元素（element）<MATH_0040>，使得<MATH_0041>对所有<MATH_0042>成立。\n由于<MATH_0043>是同构（isomorphism），还可得到<MATH_0044>表示（represents）函子（functor）<MATH_0045>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n我们断言，二元组（pair）<MATH_0046>表示（represents）函子（functor）<MATH_0047>。\n为证明这一点，设<MATH_0048>为概形（scheme），并令<MATH_0049>。\n我们将构造唯一的态射（morphism）<MATH_0050>，使得<MATH_0051>。具体来说，由子函子（subfunctors）<MATH_0052>覆盖（cover）<MATH_0053>这一条件，存在开（open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0054>，使得对每个<MATH_0055>，相应的限制（restriction）满足<MATH_0056>。\n此外，由于每个包含映射（inclusions）<MATH_0057>都可表（representable），且由开浸入（open immersions）表示，可假设各<MATH_0058>都是具有这一性质的极大开集（open）。\n由于<MATH_0059>表示（represents）函子（functor）<MATH_0060>，得到唯一的态射（morphism）<MATH_0061>，使得<MATH_0062>。在重叠部分（overlaps）<MATH_0063>上，态射（morphisms）<MATH_0064>和<MATH_0065>一致，例如可由它们都将<MATH_0066>拉回（pull back）为同一个元素（element）看出。因此，态射（morphisms）<MATH_0067>粘合（glue）成所求的唯一态射（morphism），该态射从<MATH_0068>出发。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "representing", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "universal family", "target_term": "泛族"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "factors through", "target_term": "可分解"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "factors through", "target_term": "可分解"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "represents", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "restricts", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "restricts", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "cocycle condition", "target_term": "上闭链条件"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "扎里斯基拓扑"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "represents", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "represents", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term":